# Jewelry E-Commerce Store – Version 1.0

## Overview
The Jewelry E-Commerce Store is an online shopping platform that allows
customers to browse and purchase jewelry products.

## Version 1.0 Features

### Product Management
- Display jewelry products such as rings, necklaces, earrings, and bracelets.
- Show product name, price, image, and basic description.
- Organize products into different categories.

### Customer Features
- Browse available jewelry products.
- View product details.
- Add products to the shopping cart.
- Remove products from the shopping cart.
- View the total price of selected products.

### Order Management
- Place an order for selected jewelry items.
- Enter basic customer and delivery information.
- Display order confirmation.

## Version Information
Version 1.0 provides the basic functionality required for
browsing jewelry products and placing orders.
